---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy - Dr. Mandy Manna"
  meta_title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for the Dr. Mandy Manna portfolio website."
>
  <section class="py-20" style="background-color: #fafaf8;">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

      <div class="mb-12">
        <span
          class="inline-block text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full"
          style="background-color: #e8f0eb; color: #2d5a3d;"
        >
          Legal
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-serif font-semibold mb-4" style="color: #1a2e1e;">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm" style="color: #4f6357;">Last updated: May 2025</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose max-w-none" style="color: #3a5040;">

        <div class="rounded-2xl p-8 mb-10" style="background-color: #f0f4f1; border: 1px solid #dde8de;">
          <p class="text-base leading-relaxed m-0" style="color: #5a7060;">
            This website is a professional portfolio for Dr. Mandy Manna. Your privacy is important to us.
            This policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and your rights regarding your data.
          </p>
        </div>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold mb-4" style="color: #1a2e1e;">Information We Collect</h2>
          <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            We collect only the information you voluntarily provide when using this site:
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 ml-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-2" style="background-color: #4a7c59;"></span>
              <span><strong>Contact form submissions:</strong> Your name, email address, and any message you send through the consultation request form.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-2" style="background-color: #4a7c59;"></span>
              <span><strong>Usage data:</strong> Anonymous information about how visitors interact with the site (pages visited, time spent, referring URLs) collected through standard web analytics.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            We do not collect sensitive personal data such as financial information, government identification numbers, or health records.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold mb-4" style="color: #1a2e1e;">How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed">Information you provide is used solely to:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 ml-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-2" style="background-color: #4a7c59;"></span>
              <span>Respond to your consultation or speaking engagement inquiries</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-2" style="background-color: #4a7c59;"></span>
              <span>Improve the content and usability of this website</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-2" style="background-color: #4a7c59;"></span>
              <span>Understand aggregate visitor behavior to make the site more useful</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            We will never sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold mb-4" style="color: #1a2e1e;">Cookies and Tracking</h2>
          <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            This site may use cookies and similar technologies to analyze site traffic and improve your browsing experience.
            These are small text files stored on your device that help us understand how the site is used.
          </p>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            You can control or disable cookies through your browser settings at any time. Disabling cookies will not prevent you from using this site, though some features may behave differently.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold mb-4" style="color: #1a2e1e;">Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            This website is hosted on Netlify. When you visit the site, Netlify may collect standard server log data including your IP address and browser type in accordance with their own
            <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #2d5a3d; text-decoration: underline;">privacy policy</a>.
            We may also use third-party analytics services that operate under their own privacy policies.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold mb-4" style="color: #1a2e1e;">Data Retention</h2>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            Contact form submissions are retained only as long as necessary to respond to your inquiry and maintain a record of that correspondence.
            You may request deletion of your data at any time by contacting us directly.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold mb-4" style="color: #1a2e1e;">Your Rights</h2>
          <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed">You have the right to:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 ml-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-2" style="background-color: #4a7c59;"></span>
              <span>Request access to any personal data we hold about you</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-2" style="background-color: #4a7c59;"></span>
              <span>Request correction of inaccurate information</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-2" style="background-color: #4a7c59;"></span>
              <span>Request deletion of your personal data</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-2" style="background-color: #4a7c59;"></span>
              <span>Opt out of any future communications</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold mb-4" style="color: #1a2e1e;">Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            This website is not directed at children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.
            If you believe a child has submitted personal information through this site, please contact us so we can remove it promptly.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold mb-4" style="color: #1a2e1e;">Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with a revised date at the top.
            Continued use of this website after any changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold mb-4" style="color: #1a2e1e;">Contact</h2>
          <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            If you have questions about this privacy policy or how your data is handled, please reach out through the
            <a href="/consult" style="color: #2d5a3d; text-decoration: underline;">consultation page</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
